What kind of songs have made the ranking?

18
00:03:31,338 --> 00:03:35,338
それではまず、10位から8位まで見ていきましょう！
Well then, let's first take a look from 10th to 8th place!

19
00:03:35,708 --> 00:03:36,638
Count Night！
Count Night!

20
00:04:03,953 --> 00:04:06,913
大キライだったそばかすをちょっと
Those freckles I used to hate so much...

21
00:04:06,913 --> 00:04:10,013
ひととなしてため息をひとつ
I let out a single sigh.

22
00:04:10,013 --> 00:04:14,613
ヘヴィー級の恋はみごとに角砂糖と一緒に溶けた
My heavyweight love melted away completely right along with a sugar cube.

23
00:04:15,013 --> 00:04:17,923
前よりももっとやせた胸にちょっと
On my chest, even thinner than before,

24
00:04:17,923 --> 00:04:21,053
チクッとささるトゲがイタイ
a prickly thorn stings and hurts.

25
00:04:21,323 --> 00:04:27,923
星占いもあてにならないわ
Even horoscope readings aren't reliable.

26
00:04:29,393 --> 00:04:39,113
もっと遠くまで 一緒にゆけたら ねえ
If we could go even further together, hey,

27
00:04:39,523 --> 00:04:46,403
うれしくて それだけで
I'd be so happy, just with that.

28
00:04:46,683 --> 00:04:52,283
想い出は いつも キレイだけど
Memories are always beautiful, but

29
00:04:52,483 --> 00:04:57,733
それだけじゃ おなかがすくわ
that alone leaves me hungry.

30
00:04:57,973 --> 00:05:00,000
本当は せつない夜なのに
Even though it's truly a heartbreaking night...

31
00:05:00,436 --> 00:05:03,526
本当は せつない夜なのに
Even though it's actually a painful night,

32
00:05:04,916 --> 00:05:06,716
どうしてかしら？
Why is it?

33
00:05:06,716 --> 00:05:09,616
あの人の笑顔も
I can't even remember

34
00:05:09,616 --> 00:05:12,616
思い出せないの
that person's smile.

35
00:05:24,036 --> 00:05:29,626
こわして なおして わかってるのに
Breaking it, fixing it, even though I know...

36
00:05:30,016 --> 00:05:34,426
それが あたしの 性格だから
That's just my personality,

37
00:05:35,126 --> 00:05:40,826
もどかしい気持ちで あやふやなままで
with this frustrating feeling, remaining vague,

38
00:05:41,016 --> 00:05:47,326
それでも イイ 恋をしてきた
even so, I've had good love affairs.

39
00:05:48,816 --> 00:05:54,026
おもいきりあげた
Opening it wide open,

40
00:05:54,416 --> 00:06:00,626
左耳のピアスには ねえ
the earring in my left ear, hey...

41
00:06:01,016 --> 00:06:07,126
笑えない エピソード
an episode I can't laugh about.

42
00:06:07,816 --> 00:06:10,926
Wow Wow

43
00:06:11,116 --> 00:06:17,326
そばかすの数を かぞえてみる
I try counting the number of freckles.

44
00:06:17,816 --> 00:06:23,226
汚れたぬいぐるみ抱いて
Hugging a dirty stuffed animal,

45
00:06:23,416 --> 00:06:28,526
胸をさす トゲは 消えないけど
the thorn piercing my chest won't go away, but

46
00:06:29,016 --> 00:06:34,026
カエルちゃんも ウサギちゃんも
both the frog and the rabbit

47
00:06:34,216 --> 00:06:40,626
笑ってくれるの
will smile for me.

48
00:06:42,816 --> 00:06:49,226
想い出は いつも キレイだけど
Memories are always beautiful, but

49
00:06:49,816 --> 00:06:54,926
それだけじゃ おなかが すくの
just that isn't enough to fill my stomach.

50
00:06:55,216 --> 00:07:00,626
本当は せつない夜なのに
Even though it's actually a painful night,

51
00:07:01,016 --> 00:07:03,816
どうしてかしら？
Why is it?

52
00:07:03,816 --> 00:07:06,626
あの人の涙も
I can't even remember

53
00:07:06,626 --> 00:07:11,626
思い出せないの
that person's tears either.

54
00:07:12,116 --> 00:07:17,426
思い出せないの
I can't remember them.

55
00:07:18,016 --> 00:07:28,326
Wow wow La la...

56
00:07:29,016 --> 00:07:34,326
どうしてなの？
Why is it?

57
00:08:05,116 --> 00:08:09,826
Please don't say "You are lazy" だって本当は crazy
Please don't say "You are lazy," because actually I'm crazy.

58
